// KV load: 2 × token_budget × d_head bytes
// Total: 2 × d_head × (seq_len/page_size + token_budget) bytes
// vs full: 2 × d_head × seq_len bytes
// Reduction factor: 1 / (1/page_size + token_budget/seq_len)
```

